  "description": "The alerts API can be used to perform CRUD operations on alerts. An alert is a Databricks SQL\nobject that periodically runs a query, evaluates a condition of its result, and notifies one\nor more users and/or notification destinations if the condition was met.\nAlerts can be scheduled using the `sql_task` type of the Jobs API, e.g. :method:jobs/create.\n\n**Warning**: This API is deprecated. Please see the latest version of the Databricks SQL API. [Learn more](https://docs.databricks.com/en/sql/dbsql-api-latest.html)",
